                  },
                  {
                    "value": "star schema — FactBehavior joined to DimDate (marked date table), DimDevice, DimRegion, DimSegment; DimPage drives navigation tables. All logic lives in DAX measures (_Measures, organized in display folders).",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "10pt",
                      "color": "#DDE2EF"
